&lt;p&gt;The Financial Services Sales team helps customers use GitLab to improve how they build, secure, and deliver software. You&#39;ll lead through Regional Sales Directors and Strategic Account Executives, working across GitLab to build lasting customer relationships, support customer success, and deliver predictable growth.&lt;/p&gt;
